  "body": "I would like to see the option to let your messages expire over time so servers are instructed to destroy the messages after expiry and more importantly that you can have a room where all messages expire over time. Sensible times to me could be a day, a week, a month or a year.\r\n\r\nSo two features:\r\n\r\n1) be able to set messages in a room to expire.\r\n2) be able to let your own messages expire.\r\n\r\nWhere expire means all federated servers are instructed to remove the message.\r\n\r\nThanks",
